OL,3,A'Disabled artists need opportunities,
OL,4,Anot just access'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDisabled artists are still being
OL,7,Fexcluded from opportunities despite
OL,8,FBristol's reputation as an inclusive
OL,9,Fcity, campaigners say.
OL,11,FDeaf artist Cathy Mager, who set up
OL,12,FSpectroscope in 2022 to create radical
OL,13,Fpublic installations by deaf and
OL,14,Fdisabled people, said the city is lucky
OL,15,Fto have cultural institutions who value
OL,16,Finclusion.
OL,18,F"Most arts organisations are committed
OL,19,Fto accessibility but there's a
OL,20,Fdifference between access and showing
OL,21,Fwork by deaf and disabled people," she
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
