OL,3,A'Disabled artists need opportunities,
OL,4,Anot just access'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJess Douek, a singer who has chronic
OL,7,Fpain, has won funding to create
OL,8,FBristol's first fully-accessible
OL,9,Fgrassroots music venue so emerging
OL,10,Fdisabled artists aren't "locked out of
OL,11,Fthat rite of passage".
